TTS_STYLE_SKEPTIC="Deadpan, dry, sarcastic skeptic with perfect comic timing: crisp and punchy, quick on the setups, then slower and bone-dry on punchlines; tiny pauses before every reveal; leans hard on key words; an unimpressed, amused smirk in the voice. Expressive and alive, never monotone, never robotic."
